<h1 class="page-title"><%= t('aboutTitle') %></h1>
<div class="section">
  <p><b>LoveLink</b> — <%= t('appTag') %></p>
  <p>LoveLink is a mobile-first dating app for Ethiopia. Answer a few questions, share your city and location, and meet real people near you — sorted by distance and how well you match.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>18+ only. One phone = one account.</li>
    <li>Matches happen only when <b>both</b> people like each other.</li>
    <li>Chat only inside a match. Report or block anyone, anytime.</li>
    <li>Your exact location is never shown — only the distance.</li>
    <li>First 3 matches are free. Premium (<%= fmtETB(PREMIUM_FEE) %> one-time) unlocks unlimited matches and messages.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Made in Addis Ababa, Ethiopia.</p>
</div>
